### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "test3",
    "email": "test4@gmail.com",
    "password": "testpassword",
    "profileImageUrl": ""
}

### Add income
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/incomes
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5NzIzOWE3NzU0NjU1YjRiYWVjMjRmNiIsImlhdCI6MTc2OTEwMTExMCwiZXhwIjoxNzcxNjkzMTEwfQ.DOsbkvd6t8kZkrUtTFkS78x1IqzFZUAfmeXv14uxqWc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1200,
    "source": "Salary",
    "date": "2026-01-22T10:00:00.000Z"
}

